      "id": "claim_016366efa67741a8a1741f559bdfd51b",
      "statement": "As of PPH-API-CAT-2026.3, v1 consumer migration status is: IVR wire status (Contact Center Tech) migrated 2026-05; Service Center CRM (CRM Engineering) in progress with a 2026-12 target; Wire Room console (Payment Operations Tech) migrated to IWB in 2025; and cbo-wire-bff (CBO Wire Center squad) not started, tracked separately as unscheduled CBO-4471.",
